# Development Workflows

## First-Time Setup

```bash
git clone <repo-url>
cd {{ repo_slug }}
bash scripts/bootstrap.sh
# Follow the printed instructions to add scripts/ to your PATH.
```

After setup, `croot` is available as a command from anywhere in the repo.

## Daily Development Loop

```bash
# Before committing — run all checks
croot check
# or:
uv run nox -s check
```
