## Template Updates

```bash
croot update
# Review every changed file. Resolve conflicts with your custom changes.
# Commit the result.
```

Files you can freely customize without worrying about template conflicts:
- `docs/agent-src/` — your project's agent instructions
- `python/`, `typescript/`, `java/` application code
- `docs/` project documentation

Files managed by the crossroot template (review changes carefully):
- `pyproject.toml`, `noxfile.py`
- `scripts/` shell scripts
- `.github/workflows/`

## Regenerating Agent Docs

After editing anything in `docs/agent-src/`:

```bash
croot gen-docs
git add CLAUDE.md AGENTS.md .cursor/rules/
git commit -m "chore: regenerate agent docs"
```
